  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不再欺骗自己的心  (Refusing to Lie to Herself)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Unable to hold back her tears any longer, Bu Xiaogu tells Chun Yuqiao how completely he fills her thoughts every single day. Listen to their emotional Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "每天我的情绪都是跟着你走的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你开心我就开心，你不开心我就不开心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果哪天看不着你，我就跟生了病一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你那么优秀，我又能有什么办法呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "暴雨直播那天，我实在忍不住了，因为我就是特别喜欢你啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拿上你的东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得以前我都搞错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不应该骗我自己，我就是特别喜欢你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快走啊，拿上你的东西离开我家！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你照顾我，那我走了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "每天我的情绪都是跟着你走的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every single day my emotions rise and fall right along with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你开心我就开心，你不开心我就不开心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When you are happy I am happy, and when you are unhappy I am unhappy too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果哪天看不着你，我就跟生了病一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If a day goes by without seeing you, I feel practically sick.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你那么优秀，我又能有什么办法呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When you are so extraordinary, what am I supposed to do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "暴雨直播那天，我实在忍不住了，因为我就是特别喜欢你啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On the day of the storm broadcast I could not hold back anymore, because I truly like you so much!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拿上你的东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pick up your things.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得以前我都搞错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I realise now I had everything wrong before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不应该骗我自己，我就是特别喜欢你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I should stop lying to myself—I really do like you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快走啊，拿上你的东西离开我家！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go on—take your things and leave my home!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你照顾我，那我走了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for looking after me; I will head out now.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
